  "solution": "Giả sử <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Theo quy tắc hình bình hành, suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math> như hình vẽ.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>60</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, nên tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math> đều. Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>50</mn><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math> N.\n\t\t<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Đúng.</li><li>Sai. Do hai lực <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math> không cùng phương.</li><li>Đúng.</li><li>Sai. Lực tổng hợp tạo với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math> một góc <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msup><mn>30</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></semantics></math>.</li></ol>",
